+    member, status 2, and **nothing** on stdout.
+
+    An incomplete archive may remain -- FR-021 permits that explicitly and the tool does not roll
+    back. What must never happen is the summary line being printed, because that would make a
+    half-made archive read as a result. This is the test that pins that down.
